Subject: [PATCH] Clamp dual-Kawase taps to the populated pyramid level

Upstream: wlrfx/scenefx, locked 37ccd723bef49e6891156ffafce8f549f01446cc
Location: render/fx_renderer/{fx_pass.c,shaders/blur{1,2}.frag}

Full-output FBOs are reused for every reduced blur level. GL_CLAMP_TO_EDGE
only protects the allocation boundary, so an upsample tap near the right or
bottom of a reduced level reads stale content outside that level. Clamp to
the populated texel centers, retaining the radius, passes and optimized cache.
Reproduced with Mango 0.18.3, 2560x1600 at scale 1.5 and a bright center/dark
right wallpaper. No Noctalia geometry or opacity changes are needed.

